Be sure you're using the highlight pet option and maybe even be sure
your pets are named if you want to be sure who is attacking what.
Also, carry around a lichen corpse or some food type that cats/dogs
don't like to eat.  These can be tossed at them and they'll become
peaceful without using up the food item itself.  Really handy for bones
files with tough pets that you coudln't take on safely.  Also good if
you don't want extra pets since the vegi corpses won't actually tame
them. Vegi corpses will tame equines, so they're also handy for tough
warhorses you might come across.

